COMPILATION OF: E48A2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A2

   1 a 0000 E48A2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] THE NEGATED BIT TEST IN AN IF, WITH AN ELSE.
   4 a 0006      CREATE:35 has `if ^eofile then do; ... end;' with NO else;
   5 a 0006      this asks whether the ELSE is reached through the same
   6 a 0006      5-byte chain, which no object in the tree shows. */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   if ^b then
   9 c 000D      put list('T');
  10 c 0027   else
  11 c 0027      put list('F');
  12 c 003E   stop;
  13 a 0041 end E48A2;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 0003
FREE SYMS = 38B0
END  COMPILATION
